      "id": "C1",
      "strength": "strongest",
      "status": "observed",
      "current_claim": "Validation failure loops generally back through planning and repair.",
      "finding": "The public execution coordinator forbids re-delegating a returned task. Workers may retry internally; terminal retry requires an explicit user decision and a new delegation.",
